---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base
  title="Terms of use — LunaTrack"
  description="LunaTrack's terms of use: no warranty, not a medical device, the minimum age to sign up, and how Google Play billing governs purchases."
  path="/terms"
>
  <h1 class="display text-[2.1rem] sm:text-[2.6rem]">Terms of use</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-prose text-sm opacity-70">Last updated 13 September 2026.</p>

  <section class="prose-body mt-14 max-w-prose">
    <span class="phase-rule text-outline dark:text-white/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <h2 class="display-sm mt-4 text-[1.4rem]">Not a medical device</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      LunaTrack is not a medical device. It does not diagnose, treat or prevent
      any condition, and predictions are estimates based on the averages you log
      — not a method of contraception. Always consult a qualified clinician for
      medical concerns. See also our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="underline">privacy policy</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="prose-body mt-14 max-w-prose">
    <span class="phase-rule text-outline dark:text-white/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <h2 class="display-sm mt-4 text-[1.4rem]">No warranty</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      LunaTrack is provided "as is," without warranties of any kind, to the
      extent allowed by law. We do not guarantee the app will be error-free,
      uninterrupted, or fit for any particular purpose.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="prose-body mt-14 max-w-prose">
    <span class="phase-rule text-outline dark:text-white/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <h2 class="display-sm mt-4 text-[1.4rem]">Age requirement</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      You must be old enough to hold a Google account in your country — commonly
      13 or older, but higher in some regions — to create a LunaTrack account.
      Do not create an account on behalf of someone who does not meet that
      requirement.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="prose-body mt-14 max-w-prose">
    <span class="phase-rule text-outline dark:text-white/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <h2 class="display-sm mt-4 text-[1.4rem]">Purchases</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      Premium is a one-time in-app purchase processed by the Google Play Store.
      Google Play's own terms, billing and refund policies govern that purchase;
      we do not receive or store your payment details. See
      <a href="/features" class="underline">what Premium removes</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="prose-body mt-14 max-w-prose">
    <span class="phase-rule text-outline dark:text-white/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <h2 class="display-sm mt-4 text-[1.4rem]">Your account</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      You're responsible for the accuracy of what you log and for keeping your
      account credentials to yourself. You can request deletion of your account
      at any time from Settings — see the
      <a href="/privacy-policy" class="underline">privacy policy</a> for how that works.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="prose-body mt-14 max-w-prose">
    <span class="phase-rule text-outline dark:text-white/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <h2 class="display-sm mt-4 text-[1.4rem]">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      Questions about these terms: <span>your-email@example.com</span>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
